            <ArticleTitle>Role of drug eluting stents in diabetic patients.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>579-81</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>There is a clear need for a large multicentre trial comparing the efficacy of the two available drug eluting stents, sirolimus and paclitaxel, in diabetic patients with multivessel disease.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
